 <p>If you’re carrying high-interest debt, a 0% APR balance transfer offer can be a smart way to slow the ticking interest and pay down principal more quickly. But not all 0% introductory APR periods are created equal. The 0% APR intro balance transfer cards available in 2026 vary in terms of length of the intro period, transfer fees, ongoing APR after the promo ends, and other features like rewards or annual fees. This practical guide helps you compare current options, understand how to use them effectively, and avoid common mistakes.</p>
 
